+## care_event
+
+护理事件最小接口：
+
+```text
+POST /api/v3/care/events
+GET  /api/v3/care/events?subject_id=sub_patient_xxx
+GET  /api/v3/care/events?room=R1203&bed=B1&limit=20
+```
+
+`room/bed` 会统一规范化；旧 SQLite 中缺少 `severity/source/created_by/ts` 的 `care_events` 表会在初始化时补列并保留旧数据。`/api/v3/context/chat` 只有授权通过后才会返回 `modalities.care_events`。
